sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GapCentralResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GapCentral]
    Note over App, Node: Standby() is allowed from standby, scanning, initiating, or connected.<br>It terminates the current activity and returns the Node to standby.<br>Calling from standby still yields CurrentState(standby).
    App->>Node: GapCentral.Standby()
    Node-->>App: GapCentralResponse.CurrentState(standby)
